The start record puts Paul Hardy in slot 8 with no position, and Hardy has no
dline. Willie Cornelius has two first-position dlines: catcher for all 27 outs
and pitcher for 6 outs, which cannot both be true. Cornelius is third in the
pitcher's batting slot and the second pitcher in the pline records, while
Hardy is first in slot 8 and catcher is the only position no other starter
holds. The catcher dline is reassigned to Hardy, Hardy's start record gets
position 2, and Cornelius's pitcher dline becomes the second pitcher.

